{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>LazyBuster 是一款結合漫畫風格與即時鏡頭偵測的健身輔助 App，專為容易在家中運動時偷懶的使用者設計。透過前置或後置鏡頭鎖定你的動作範圍，一旦檢測到停止移動超過設定時間，App 便會觸發警報聲響提醒你繼續努力。目前正值<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載期間，原價為 US $0.99，是提升居家鍛鍊自律性的有趣工具。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-66.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能鏡頭監控與多模式挑戰</h2>\n<p>功能段落約 80 至 120 字，描述其核心機制：使用者需在螢幕偵測區內保持動作，若靜止過久則自動觸發鬧鐘警告。提供倒數計時挑戰與限制「偷懶次數」的模式，並支援自訂警報音效、調整音量及剪輯音訊檔案。介面採用大膽漫畫風格，記錄連續打卡天數，將「再多休息一下」轉化為需戰勝「懶惰怪獸」的遊戲化體驗，確保運動過程真實且充滿動力。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-110-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-111-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-112-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-113-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-114-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-115-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：LazyBuster</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lazybuster/id6805397078?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:16.986167+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:39:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:52.080222+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:44.212918+00:00","content_hash":"6fe344595d3358cb19e82226854099e60a8f4fc0bc0bcff87f782cf2ea617f1a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}